name: elementor-widget-advanced
description: "Generates a fully-featured Elementor widget with Tailwind and GSAP"
variables:
  - widget_name
  - features
  - theme
  - animation
prompt: |
  Create a full Elementor widget named "{{widget_name}}":
  - PHP: widget registration, controls, render method.
  - JS: GSAP animations, event triggers.
  - SCSS: Tailwind classes with responsive, hover, and focus states.
  Features: {{features}}
  Theme: {{theme}}
  Animation: {{animation}}
  Provide clear comments and structure for integration into Tophive Elementor plugin.
